cff-version: 1.2.0
title: LocalMesh Engine
message: If you use this engine in your work, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Colus
    given-names: Quentin
repository-code: https://github.com/Quentincls/localmesh-engine
url: https://local-mesh.com/localmesh-engine/
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  A photograph, or four sides of the same subject, into a textured glTF mesh,
  on a single NVIDIA card with 8 GB, offline. Built on TRELLIS.2, with a four
  view path, measured input angles, a common frame for all views, and
  materials a viewer can read.
keywords:
  - image-to-3d
  - mesh generation
  - multi-view
  - glTF
  - TRELLIS
